// CANDIDATE animation calibration, NOT recovered original server timings.
// Asset roles: seq.pack 3480,3487,3482-3484,3485,3488,3494; identity fields preserved in this unit.
// Client exact-move units are 20 ms cycles. p_delay(n) resumes after n+1 server ticks (600 ms).
// No animation lead-in/start-cycle offset. Existing agility_exactmove calling convention.
// Non-looping movement ends match the packed asset's summed frame delays (candidate visual calibration).
// Server delays round up to a full following tick. Slope loops its eight frames across four tiles.
^ape_candidate_anim_delay = 0
^ape_candidate_start_cycle = 0
// Stone: 36 asset cycles (720 ms), server delay 1 (2 ticks).
